- lidar_link moved on top of the 600x400x300 body (x 0.24, z 0.34; estimates)
- chassis box height 0.30, storage container on the top deck (visual only)
- front_scan_filter: field_of_view_deg param (default 360), lidar_fov_deg
  launch arg; Gazebo ray sensor now 360 samples over 360°
- tests and docs updated

